# Agent owns merge (tvscreener-rs) - hard

Greg does **not** need to agree before these. Do them yourself. Do **not** ask in chat for permission.

## Merge

| Repo | Agent duty |
| --- | --- |
| **tvscreener-rs** | When PR is green and up to date: merge (`gh pr merge --squash`). No Greg Approve required unless he said hold. |

- Do **not** ask "OK to merge?" when green.
- Do **not** `gh pr merge --rebase` onto org (strips Verified). Rebase on the **fork** first; then squash-merge.
- Hold only when Greg already said "do not merge yet" / blocked: then `--reviewer gRoussac`.
- After merge: sync fork `dev` from `upstream/dev` as usual.
- Full checklist: `github-public-quality.mdc` + `github-fork-pr.mdc`.

## Still ask Greg when

- Secrets, logins, installs needing approval.
- Creating the GitHub org repo / fork for the first time.
- Explicit hold he set in chat or on the PR.
